module cafe
kind application

# A whole latte application, in the shape a person would write one: pages in
# their own package, the wiring in `main.b`, and nothing that reaches into
# latte's internals.
#
# Both rows are relative to THIS manifest, and both are written so the same
# text resolves from `community-libs/latte/examples/cafe` and from
# `.worktrees/latte-wN/examples/cafe` — four levels up is `beans-lang/` either
# way. latte's own manifest does the same thing for the same reason.
require path "../.."
require path "../../app"
require github.com/beans-lang/espresso v0.3.0
